# X API v2 Bearer Token
# Get your token from: https://developer.twitter.com/en/portal/dashboard
# 1. Create a project and app in the X Developer Portal
# 2. Navigate to your app's "Keys and tokens" section
# 3. Generate a Bearer Token
# 4. Copy this file to .env and paste your token below

X_BEARER_TOKEN=your_bearer_token_here
